<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>海牙体系概况</title>
<script type="text/javascript" id="MathJax-script" async
  src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js">
</script>
<style>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    font-family: "SimSun", "STSong", serif;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eaf6f0 0%, #dceef0 50%, #eef5f2 100%);
    position: relative;
    min-height: 1200px;
  }
  .slide {
    width: 1800px;
    min-height: 1330px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eaf6f0 0%, #dceef0 50%, #eef5f2 100%);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 30px 40px 10px 40px;
  }
  .title {
    color: #c0392b;
    font-size: 52px;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .logo-box {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1b6b6b, #2e8b8b);
    color: white;
    padding: 15px 30px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 15px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .logo-icon {
    font-size: 40px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: white;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .logo-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .logo-cn {
    font-size: 34px;
    letter-spacing: 8px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .logo-url {
    font-size: 16px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .content {
    padding: 10px 60px 40px 60px;
  }
  .bullet-heading {
    color: #1f4e6b;
    font-size: 34px;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin: 10px 0 30px 0;
  }
  .bullet-heading::before {
    content: "■";
    color: #1f4e6b;
    margin-right: 8px;
  }
  .columns {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 40px;
    padding: 0 40px;
  }
  .column {
    flex: 1;
  }
  .col-title {
    color: #c0392b;
    font-size: 34px;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  ul.feature-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  ul.feature-list li {
    color: #c0392b;
    font-size: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 30px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  ul.feature-list li::before {
    content: "●";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 2px;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: #c0392b;
  }
  .bottom-note {
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding: 0 40px;
    color: #1f4e6b;
    font-size: 30px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 65px;
  }
  .bottom-note::before {
    content: "■";
    color: #1f4e6b;
    position: absolute;
    left: 40px;
    top: 2px;
    font-size: 24px;
  }
  .highlight-red {
    color: #c0392b;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .page-number {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 20px;
    right: 40px;
    color: #888;
    font-size: 22px;
  }
  .watermark {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
    opacity: 0.15;
    font-size: 24px;
    color: #999;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="slide">
  <div class="header">
    <div class="title">海牙体系概况</div>
    <div class="logo-box">
      <div class="logo-icon">🇨🇳</div>
      <div class="logo-text">
        <span class="logo-cn">公 益 讲 座</span>
        <span class="logo-url">www.cnipa.gov.cn/wxfw</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="content">
    <div class="bullet-heading">海牙体系的优势</div>

    <div class="columns">
      <div class="column">
        <div class="col-title">国家或地区途径</div>
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li>向多个局分别提交申请</li>
          <li>撰写多种语言的文本</li>
          <li>使用多种货币缴费</li>
          <li>分别注册</li>
          <li>分别办理续展</li>
          <li>提交申请即需委托当地代理机构</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="column">
        <div class="col-title">海牙途径</div>
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li>向一个局提交申请</li>
          <li>撰写一种语言（英/法/西）文本</li>
          <li>使用一种货币（瑞士法郎）缴费</li>
          <li>国际注册</li>
          <li>统一办理续展</li>
          <li>驳回时才需委托当地代理机构</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bottom-note">
      如果需要在<span class="highlight-red">多个</span>国家或地区获得外观设计专利权，通过海牙途径提交国际申请代替原本向不同国家或地区局提交一系列申请，可以节约工作量、时间和费用。
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="page-number">8</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
